OL,3,ATrump ousts Kimberly Guilfoyle as US
OL,4,Aambassador to Greece after corruption
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump said on Tuesday that she had done
OL,8,Fa good job, but will "not be there" in
OL,9,FGreece any longer. "I didn't like what
OL,10,FI read," he said.
OL,12,FGuilfoyle vowed to defend herself,
OL,13,Fcalling the claims false, and said the
OL,14,Fambassadorship had been the "honour of
OL,15,Fa lifetime".
